    "w": 3.65,
    "h": 0.38,
    "text": "Regional contrast",
    "lines": [
      "Regional contrast"
    ],
    "size": 22,
    "color": "#536875",
    "bold": true,
    "align": "left",
    "name": "",
    "required_height": 0.3605555555555555
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 8.1,
    "y": 12.695833333333333,
    "w": 3.65,
    "h": 3.605555555555555,
    "text": "Our stations span the coast, Cascade mountains, and drier eastern Washington. They let us study how soil moisture relates to inputs under different conditions. Station holdouts test whether the models can estimate moisture at a new site.",
    "lines": [
      "Our stations span the",
      "coast, Cascade",
      "mountains, and drier",
      "eastern Washington.",
      "They let us study how soil",
      "moisture relates to inputs",
      "under different",
      "conditions. Station",
      "holdouts test whether the",
      "models can estimate",
      "moisture at a new site."
    ],
    "size": 20,
    "color": "#536875",
    "bold": false,
    "align": "left",
    "name": "Study-area interpretation",
    "required_height": 3.605555555555555
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 0.75,
    "y": 16.495833333333334,
    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 0.6555555555555554,
    "text": "Figure 1. The seven training stations and their fitted groups. Colors identify station assignments, with no geographic boundaries implied.",
    "lines": [
      "Figure 1. The seven training stations and their fitted groups. Colors identify",
      "station assignments, with no geographic boundaries implied."
    ],
    "size": 20,
    "color": "#536875",
    "bold": false,
