    "required_height": 0.6555555555555554
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 0.75,
    "y": 17.29138888888889,
    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 2.523888888888889,
    "text": "NOAA USCRN and SNOTEL stations provide measured soil moisture. Satellite inputs include SMAP soil moisture, Sentinel-1 radar backscatter from the land surface, and Sentinel-2 surface reflectance and indices of vegetation greenness and canopy water content. We also use MODIS land-surface temperature and vegetation indices, ERA5-Land weather, and terrain, climate, land-cover, and soil descriptors.",
    "lines": [
      "NOAA USCRN and SNOTEL stations provide measured soil moisture.",
      "Satellite inputs include SMAP soil moisture, Sentinel-1 radar",
      "backscatter from the land surface, and Sentinel-2 surface reflectance",
      "and indices of vegetation greenness and canopy water content. We",
      "also use MODIS land-surface temperature and vegetation indices,",
      "ERA5-Land weather, and terrain, climate, land-cover, and soil",
      "descriptors."
    ],
    "size": 22,
    "color": "#202B35",
    "bold": false,
    "align": "left",
    "name": "",
    "required_height": 2.523888888888889
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 0.75,
    "y": 19.935277777777777,
    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 1.0816666666666666,
    "text": "The pipeline puts observations on a daily grid, fills gaps, smooths the time series, and calculates features describing recent satellite readings and weather.",
    "lines": [
      "The pipeline puts observations on a daily grid, fills gaps, smooths the",
      "time series, and calculates features describing recent satellite readings",
      "and weather."
