    "y": 12.232222222222223,
    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 0.6555555555555554,
    "text": "Figure 2. Each observation uses one specialist. x denotes the inputs, s the station, g the assignment rule, and f\u1d63 the selected model.",
    "lines": [
      "Figure 2. Each observation uses one specialist. x denotes the inputs, s the",
      "station, g the assignment rule, and f\u1d63 the selected model."
