  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 12.5,
    "y": 13.007777777777779,
    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 1.442222222222222,
    "text": "1. We fill missing router inputs with their fitting-data means and standardize features to comparable scales. K-means finds two cluster centers; a new observation goes to the nearest center. The router uses inputs alone, without measured target labels.",
    "lines": [
      "1. We fill missing router inputs with their fitting-data means and",
      "standardize features to comparable scales. K-means finds two cluster",
      "centers; a new observation goes to the nearest center. The router uses",
      "inputs alone, without measured target labels."
    ],
    "size": 22,
    "color": "#202B35",
    "bold": false,
