    "name": "",
    "required_height": 1.442222222222222
  },
  {
    "kind": "text",
    "x": 12.5,
    "y": 14.57,
    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 1.0816666666666666,
    "text": "2. For a station included in fitting, its most common group selects one specialist for all its observations. New stations receive an assignment each day. Missing routing inputs can trigger the precipitation fallback.",
    "lines": [
      "2. For a station included in fitting, its most common group selects one",
      "specialist for all its observations. New stations receive an assignment",
      "each day. Missing routing inputs can trigger the precipitation fallback."
