    "w": 11.0,
    "h": 1.8027777777777776,
    "text": "3. Both approaches use identical features, XGBoost settings, evaluation observations, and random seeds. Each specialist trains on its assigned group. Seeds control training randomness; repeated fits measure training variation, leaving uncertainty across new sites and seasons unmeasured.",
